OL,3,GNEWSAWitness appeal after man stabbed
OL,4,Aon canal towpath
OL,5,
OL,6,FDetectives have appealed for witnesses
OL,7,Fafter a man was stabbed on a canal
OL,8,Ftowpath in Glen Parva.
OL,10,FLeicestershire Police said he was
OL,11,Fattacked by two other men on the
OL,12,Ftowpath behind New Bridge Road, close
OL,13,Fto the junction with Leicester Road, at
OL,14,Fabout 14:30 BST on Friday.
OL,16,FThe victim, in his 30s, was taken to
OL,17,Fhospital with a puncture wound to his
OL,18,Fbody and cuts to his arm and face, and
OL,19,Fwas later discharged.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
